1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,800
(Penny:)Thanks.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,030
(Penny:)Wow! What's with
the fancy spread?

3
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:06,730
(Sheldon:)My new roommate
is bending over backwards

4
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,340
(Sheldon:)to ingratiate himself to me.

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:12,670
(Sheldon:)Uh, nice touch,
by the way.

6
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:14,840
What do you mean "new roommate"?
What happened to Leonard?

7
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,180
(Sheldon:)The same thing that happened
to Homo erectus.

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,850
(Sheldon:)He was replaced
by a superior species.

9
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,020
(Raj:)I'm the new Homo in town.

10
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,190
(Raj:)That came out wrong.

11
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:30,660
(Penny:)All right, let me try this
again. Where's Leonard?

12
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,990
(Raj:)He's living at my place,
so I'm living here.

13
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:35,030
(Sheldon:)You're living here
provisionally.

14
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:37,500
(Sheldon:)But I must say
it's looking good.

15
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,570
Oh Leonard and Priya
are living together?

16
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:41,570
(Penny:)That's big.

17
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:46,540
(Sheldon:)No. Origami napkin swans...

18
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:49,380
(Sheldon:)that's the headline.

19
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:52,310
(Raj:)It's a good thing.

20
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:56,620
(Howard:)So do you know what kind
of research you'll be doing

21
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,220
(Howard:)at this pharmaceutical
company?

